Package: tv-channel-dvbt
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, gnuradio (>= 3.10), gr-osmosdr, hackrf, python3 (>= 3.9)
Description: DVB-T-over-HackRF transmit chain for ffplayout
 Relays ffplayout's multicast MPEG-TS output through a GNU Radio DVB-T
 (2K/QPSK/CR1-2/GI1-4) modulator to a HackRF One for real terrestrial
 transmission.
 .
 Transmitting on broadcast TV frequencies requires local RF-broadcast
 authorization in most jurisdictions. Both systemd services ship disabled
 -- see /usr/share/doc/tv-channel-dvbt/README.md before enabling either.
